Build an Edge/Chrome New Tab Dashboard Extension

Create a modern Microsoft Edge / Google Chrome browser extension using Manifest V3 that replaces the browser's New Tab page with a custom productivity dashboard.

The dashboard should provide quick access to links, note-taking, search tools, and weather information while maintaining a consistent design language based on the existing DuckGenerator extension.

Generate a complete, production-ready extension that can be loaded immediately in Edge or Chrome Developer Mode.

Core Requirements
New Tab Override

When the user opens a new tab, display a custom dashboard instead of the browser's default New Tab page.

Use:

"chrome_url_overrides": {
  "newtab": "newtab.html"
}


The dashboard must be responsive and work well on desktops, laptops, and smaller screens.

